{"O_RA": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏从口袋掏出星核，灯光把她脸切成两半。渡鸦缓步靠近，空气像要爆裂。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA_0.mp3", "dur": 8.3}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "给你，交换开始。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA_1.mp3", "dur": 2.42}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "别后悔。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA_2.mp3", "dur": 1.99}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA.webp"}, "O_RA1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "霓虹映出寒光，林夏把蓝色芯片放在手掌，空气像被刀割。渡鸦缓步靠近，影子比人多。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1_0.mp3", "dur": 9.26}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "这是你要的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "交出。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1.webp"}, "O_RA1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏逼着渡鸦承诺，声音低沉如雨。渡鸦几乎不动，红镜片盯着她的手指。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1a_0.mp3", "dur": 7.75}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "保证林小雨无事。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.18}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "我不做保证。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1a.webp"}, "O_RA1ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核递出去，手微抖。渡鸦接过，转身消失在雨幕。黎明前她收到妹妹安全的匿名位置，然而天穹的监控仍在城市上空盘旋，未来未知。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ax_0.mp3", "dur": 14.4}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "走吧，别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ax_1.mp3", "dur": 2.06}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "暂时安全，别放松。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ax_2.mp3", "dur": 2.3}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1ax.webp"}, "O_RA1ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦接过星核，口中低语一声命令。穹顶的无人机像蜘蛛般落下；林小雨的定位被迫曝光，林夏当场被捕，妹妹彻底卷入财团的实验名单，夜色中只有陈默无助的影子守望。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ay_0.mp3", "dur": 16.42}, "1": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "结束了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ay_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "不要走开，我会回来的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1ay_2.mp3", "dur": 2.45}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1ay.webp"}, "O_RA1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏低声说出计划：以自己作底牌，换取妹妹撤离。天台上只有风与雨听她的赌注。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1b_0.mp3", "dur": 8.5}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "把我留着，放她走。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.35}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "别做傻事。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1b.webp"}, "O_RA1bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦冷冷点头，星核从林夏掌心滑出。信息随后传到林小雨电话：去指定的废站。林夏被带走，她看着妹妹匆匆远去，心里既安心又破碎。城里多了一个暗角的代价。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1bx_0.mp3", "dur": 17.26}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "姐……你真的会没事吗？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.54}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "去，别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1bx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.97}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1bx.webp"}, "O_RA1by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "陈默突然现身，枪口对准渡鸦。混乱中子弹划破雨夜，渡鸦消失在烟雾。林小雨被一名下属护走，林夏趁乱逃离，但星核被破坏，证据可能永远丢失。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1by_0.mp3", "dur": 15.41}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "放开她！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1by_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "多余的热情。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1by_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1by.webp"}, "O_RA1c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏提出条件：把星核的镜像立即传向公开网络，否则不交。天台上的空气凝结成一场最后的赌注。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1c_0.mp3", "dur": 9.89}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我把证据一起放出。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1c_1.mp3", "dur": 2.5}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "你以为你能？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1c_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1c.webp"}, "O_RA1cx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "星核镜像像流光一样被散布到城市网络。黎明时分，天穹的工程遭到质疑，顾衡的笑容在新闻里僵硬。林小雨安全脱身，林夏和陈默躲进城市的阴影，等待反扑的时机。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cx_0.mp3", "dur": 16.51}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "这只是开始。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "让人知道就够了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1cx.webp"}, "O_RA1cy": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "传输被穹顶的防火墙瞬间切断，镜像成片段散落在黑市。顾衡微笑，城市回到无眠的常态。林夏逃过一劫，但她知道，真正的战斗才刚开始。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cy_0.mp3", "dur": 14.59}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "信息是可替换的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cy_1.mp3", "dur": 2.35}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我们会再来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA1cy_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA1cy.webp"}, "O_RA2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏沉默，星核仍在口袋里。渡鸦的步伐停住，天台的雨声忽然大了几分。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2_0.mp3", "dur": 7.63}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "不交换。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "你要付出代价。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2.webp"}, "O_RA2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "陈默从阴影冲出，一记翻滚试图摁住渡鸦的武器。雨水和烟雾混成一团暴力的序曲。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2a_0.mp3", "dur": 8.88}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "别动手，我先来！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.16}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "无聊的英雄。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2a.webp"}, "O_RA2ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "星核在混乱中被陈默抢到，林夏和他翻下天台楼梯消失。黎明前他们将证据交给地下记者，城市的夜里多了一束不灭的光。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ax_0.mp3", "dur": 12.84}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "快走！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ax_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ax_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2ax.webp"}, "O_RA2ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦冷静反击，星核被夺走并迅速封存。陈默重伤，林夏拖着他逃离，但夜色里她听到妹妹的求救声——位置被曝光了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ay_0.mp3", "dur": 12.58}, "1": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "交给董事长吧。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ay_1.mp3", "dur": 1.94}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "不会放过你们。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2ay_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2ay.webp"}, "O_RA2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏冷笑，像在下棋。她故意拒绝，以诱使渡鸦露出身份与通讯轨迹——这是她早已布好的陷阱。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2b_0.mp3", "dur": 9.58}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "你们不过是有壳的乌鸦。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.47}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "挑衅会付出代价。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2b_2.mp3", "dur": 2.3}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2b.webp"}, "O_RA2bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦被捕后，陈默把他押到一处秘密房间。审问揭出更多天穹实验的线索，顾衡的阴谋浮出水面，林小雨也因此获得撤离机会。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2bx_0.mp3", "dur": 12.05}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "说出你们的计划。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.06}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "你们以为胜利了？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2bx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.97}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2bx.webp"}, "O_RA2by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "他们故意放走渡鸦，借此引出顾衡的手下。代价是短暂的失控，但林夏得到了通往顾衡核心防线的必经路径——一场更大的夜战在等待。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2by_0.mp3", "dur": 13.58}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "去告诉你的主人。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2by_1.mp3", "dur": 1.94}, "2": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "你们玩火。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2by_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2by.webp"}, "O_RA2c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏通过接口发出虚假讯号，制造援兵到达的假象。渡鸦短暂犹豫，城市的灯光像被拉扯成一张网。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2c_0.mp3", "dur": 10.32}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "十秒后援兵到达。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2c_1.mp3", "dur": 2.4}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "假的信号。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2c_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2c.webp"}, "O_RA2cx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦退到阴影中，林夏趁机带着妹妹的线索撤离。虽未带走星核，但她保住了最重要的东西：林小雨的生命和继续战斗的机会。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cx_0.mp3", "dur": 12.1}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "姐姐，谢谢。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "保重，别参与报复。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.33}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2cx.webp"}, "O_RA2cy": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "天穹识别出虚假信号并回放了真实轨迹，渡鸦马上将位置报告回去。顾衡派出直升机，天台被 vollständig 封锁，林夏和林小雨被迫分开逃生。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cy_0.mp3", "dur": 14.11}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "别想逃。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cy_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "分散撤离，掩护我！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA2cy_2.mp3", "dur": 2.5}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA2cy.webp"}, "O_RA3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏做出惊人一举：当面交出的是复制品，原件仍握在她掌心。渡鸦的脚步不知不觉被牵引。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3_0.mp3", "dur": 9.72}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "这只是副本。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "别耍花招。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3.webp"}, "O_RA3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏计划把真芯片卖给地下反抗组织，用换来的资源护送妹妹远走高飞。交易在雨中游走，城市的阴暗角落有新主张。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3a_0.mp3", "dur": 12.5}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "价格不是问题。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.97}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "我要一起走！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3a.webp"}, "O_RA3ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "地下组织付清代价并提供假身份与撤离路线。黎明时林小雨远走国外，林夏带着报酬和未竟的仇走向更长的战线——她失去了直接曝光的机会，但保住了最重要的人。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ax_0.mp3", "dur": 16.13}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "我们会再见的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ax_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "活着回来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ax_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3ax.webp"}, "O_RA3ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "所谓买家是穹顶的线人，交换瞬间变成包围。林夏被逼到绝路，星核被没收，林小雨被迫成为实验的候选人。顾衡在高楼之上满足地微笑。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ay_0.mp3", "dur": 14.28}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "聪明的人也会被算计。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ay_1.mp3", "dur": 2.59}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "你们不会得逞。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3ay_2.mp3", "dur": 1.92}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3ay.webp"}, "O_RA3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏决定亲自把真芯片交给顾衡，以博取更有利的位置或更大保护。这是极端的赌注：以敌为友或被吞噬。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3b_0.mp3", "dur": 10.85}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我要跟董事长谈判。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.23}, "2": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "你走得很远。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3b.webp"}, "O_RA3bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡接受了芯片的真件，承诺给林夏与妹妹一张‘免死牌’作为交换。表面上的安宁背后，是更深的控制契约。林夏带着复杂的胜利与沉重的代价回到夜色中。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3bx_0.mp3", "dur": 15.38}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "你很清楚代价。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3bx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "只要妹妹安全。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3bx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.94}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3bx.webp"}, "O_RA3by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡当场将林夏招安，星核被封存进穹顶的核心。林夏被迫成为财团信息网的一颗棋子，妹妹得到安全却换来姐姐彻底的失自由。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3by_0.mp3", "dur": 13.15}, "1": {"speaker": "Gu Heng", "text": "你会成为我们的利刃。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.3}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我不会成为帮凶。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3by_2.mp3", "dur": 1.94}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3by.webp"}, "O_RA3c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏不交也不卖，她将真芯片藏入城市的某处，只留下引渡的副本。夜色成为她的盟友，时间是她的赌注。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3c_0.mp3", "dur": 10.25}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "等到最合适的时机。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3c_1.mp3", "dur": 2.38}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "别让时间把我们吞掉。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3c_2.mp3", "dur": 2.4}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3c.webp"}, "O_RA3cx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "星核被封存在城市一个不起眼的角落。林夏与陈默过上游走于阴影的生活，等待时机揭露穹顶。生活被推向长期的对抗，但真相终有一天会被拉进光里。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cx_0.mp3", "dur": 15.24}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我们等一个机会。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.9}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "我陪你。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3cx.webp"}, "O_RA3cy": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "穹顶的长臂追踪到藏匿处。无人机摧毁那块角落，星核与希望化为碎片。林小雨被定位，林夏的每一步下一秒都可能是死亡。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cy_0.mp3", "dur": 12.5}, "1": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "没有藏匿可言。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cy_1.mp3", "dur": 1.97}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我会重新来过。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RA3cy_2.mp3", "dur": 1.99}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RA3cy.webp"}, "O_RB": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏眼角一瞥，芯片在袖中与假货互换。渡鸦的视线像雷达扫过却错过了节拍。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB_0.mp3", "dur": 8.74}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "请检查。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "你的手……干净。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB_2.mp3", "dur": 2.78}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB.webp"}, "O_RB1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏面无表情，把袖中硬块推向交易桌，雨声像锤。天空的霓虹把她侧脸切成刀锋。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1_0.mp3", "dur": 8.81}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "拿好。别试探。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1_1.mp3", "dur": 2.71}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "……", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1_2.mp3", "dur": 0.0}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1.webp"}, "O_RB1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏袖口微闪，发蓝接口投出冷光，渡鸦的视线被拉扯，半秒差距如生死线。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1a_0.mp3", "dur": 7.66}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "把重点看这儿。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "……短暂偏移。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1a_2.mp3", "dur": 2.33}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1a.webp"}, "O_RB1ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏在巷口汽雾中融入黑暗，把星核藏进假底仓。陈默从阴影里递来帽子，两人的背影被霓虹切割，黎明前他们消失在城市骨架里，星核成了仅存的筹码。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ax_0.mp3", "dur": 15.46}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "走，别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ax_1.mp3", "dur": 2.4}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "小雨安全最重要。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ax_2.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1ax.webp"}, "O_RB1ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏一个翻转，夺过渡鸦的长狙，一枪打碎了天台的静谧。渡鸦倒地，咳出一口黑血，城市的警报像潮水般涌来。陈默牺牲挡下一发，林夏抱着妹妹般的绝望与胜利混合。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ay_0.mp3", "dur": 16.92}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "不可能……", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ay_1.mp3", "dur": 1.99}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "你活着就够了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1ay_2.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1ay.webp"}, "O_RB1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把手伸直让渡鸦检查，但眼神像冰。她赌上沉默与信任，赌一赌对方有没有兴趣深入刨根问底。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1b_0.mp3", "dur": 10.85}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "放手让我看。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.59}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "你只看这一样。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.9}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1b.webp"}, "O_RB1bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦的手在假芯片上停住，真正的星核滑出，投影立刻跳出实验名单与受害人画面。天穹的罪行在高空被点亮，顾衡的脸映在窗上，城市开始觉醒。代价是沉重：渡鸦开枪，陈默负伤，但星核发出的光比雨更刺眼。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1bx_0.mp3", "dur": 21.24}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你们以为这样就能改变？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.81}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "我们不会沉默！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1bx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.9}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1bx.webp"}, "O_RB1by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦发现异常但收起怀疑，以沉默交换：林夏交出部分数据日志，作为放行条件。林小雨被允许离开，但星核仍被封锁一角，正义被延期成烟。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1by_0.mp3", "dur": 14.26}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "把那部分给我。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.62}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "你欠我的不是账，是时间。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB1by_2.mp3", "dur": 2.95}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB1by.webp"}, "O_RB2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏故意手抖，假芯片掉落在边缘，像个诱饵。渡鸦的身形像乌鸦收拢，拉近到危险距离。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2_0.mp3", "dur": 9.36}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "糟糕……", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "别动。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2.webp"}, "O_RB2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏按下隐蔽的楼顶控制键，警报与雾幕同时启动。渡鸦被短暂致盲，城市的高灯把他们裹进白茫。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2a_0.mp3", "dur": 9.98}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "现在！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "冲！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2a.webp"}, "O_RB2ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "混乱中，林夏把星核收进相机包，陈默挡在他们前面。两人消失在暴雨与雾气里。代价：渡鸦未被制止，顾衡随后启动更严苛监管，但星核安全带来了继续斗争的希望。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ax_0.mp3", "dur": 16.97}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "保住它，我们还有机会。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ax_1.mp3", "dur": 3.19}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "先保住小雨。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ax_2.mp3", "dur": 1.92}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2ax.webp"}, "O_RB2ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "陈默抄起一把子弹，林夏硬生生从渡鸦手中抢下狙击。交火撕裂夜色，天台上血迹和雨交融。胜利换来沉重账单：友人受伤，城市的监控更近一步。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ay_0.mp3", "dur": 15.14}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "愚蠢的人类。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ay_1.mp3", "dur": 2.33}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "别再动。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2ay_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2ay.webp"}, "O_RB2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏故意让渡鸦抓住自己，声音像被割断。她用身体做筹码，赌一赌对方的冷酷里是否藏着一丝交换的逻辑。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2b_0.mp3", "dur": 10.61}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "带走我，放了她。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.26}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "协议。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2b.webp"}, "O_RB2bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦把林小雨带来遇险地，按协议留下了穹顶一段内部通讯作为担保。林夏获释，得到了一条钩住顾衡的一线证据。代价是她的信任与时间，夜色里他们分道扬镳。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2bx_0.mp3", "dur": 16.22}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "这够吗？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.02}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "够了，先救她。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2bx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.11}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2bx.webp"}, "O_RB2by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦冷冷点头，一句话未说就把林小雨推回林夏怀里，然后消失在雨帘里。林夏抱着妹妹，发现自己换来的是沉默而非同盟。城市的胜利仍未到来，但妹妹活着。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2by_0.mp3", "dur": 16.03}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐，你没事吧？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.02}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我在。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB2by_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB2by.webp"}, "O_RB3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把真星核摔在桌上，数据投影立刻飞溅成蓝色星雨。38层的交易瞬间变成审判庭，城市的眼睛被点亮。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3_0.mp3", "dur": 11.38}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "全城都应该知道真相。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3_1.mp3", "dur": 2.59}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你以为这样就能胜利？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3_2.mp3", "dur": 2.38}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3.webp"}, "O_RB3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡在高楼之上冷笑，命令像冷弹下达：渡鸦打开狙击瞄镜，城市的天穹为他铺路，子弹随之而来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3a_0.mp3", "dur": 10.15}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "让这夜安静。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.94}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "承命。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3a.webp"}, "O_RB3ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "陈默把林小雨推向安全出口，林夏踩着栏杆站成靶子。子弹贯穿了她的风衣，血在霓虹下像花瓣散开。她笑了，像在告诉妹妹：去活下去，别为我哭泣。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ax_0.mp3", "dur": 15.19}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "快走！别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ax_1.mp3", "dur": 2.69}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "别死在我面前。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ax_2.mp3", "dur": 2.4}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3ax.webp"}, "O_RB3ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏冲向狙击手，和渡鸦在狭窄的天台上搏斗。最终两人都倒下，天台像被撕裂的画布。胜利短暂而残酷：渡鸦死了，但星核摔碎了，真相散成碎片。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ay_0.mp3", "dur": 15.17}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "结束了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ay_1.mp3", "dur": 2.02}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "真相不能随你灭。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3ay_2.mp3", "dur": 2.16}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3ay.webp"}, "O_RB3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡面不改色，仿佛雨只是景深的一部分。他冷冷下令保护记录，而不是瞬间清场，选择用法律与金钱碾压真相的路线。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3b_0.mp3", "dur": 12.14}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "让法庭处理。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3b_1.mp3", "dur": 1.97}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "他们会被绞死的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3b_2.mp3", "dur": 2.02}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3b.webp"}, "O_RB3bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核交给一位地下记者，交由法律程序公审。庭审成为新港的裂缝，顾衡表面镇定但内心动摇。尽管财团运作仍顽强，天穹受限，真相被写进判决书，城市开始缓慢变化。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3bx_0.mp3", "dur": 18.26}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "让世界看看。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3bx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.92}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "这不过是开始。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3bx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.21}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3bx.webp"}, "O_RB3by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核的一部分分散写入数个备份，带着妹妹逃向海外暗港。真相碎片散落在黑市与媒体间，虽然没有一夜改朝换代，但穹顶的统治被永久动摇。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3by_0.mp3", "dur": 14.76}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我们还会回来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3by_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "我会学会战斗。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RB3by_2.mp3", "dur": 1.9}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RB3by.webp"}, "O_RC": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏按下隐藏信号，天台投影骤变，警报与激光编织出恐怖的烟火。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC_0.mp3", "dur": 7.06}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "现在！跑！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC_1.mp3", "dur": 2.28}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "掩护你撤！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC_2.mp3", "dur": 2.16}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC.webp"}, "O_RC1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "投影与警报吞没了霓虹，天台成了迷离的火海。林夏趁乱拔出星核，目光像锋利的冰。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1_0.mp3", "dur": 8.83}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "现在，跟我走。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1_1.mp3", "dur": 2.14}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "别带着小雨冲动。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1_2.mp3", "dur": 2.54}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1.webp"}, "O_RC1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏抱紧星核，带着林小雨向天台楼梯冲下。雾与激光像刀，脚步在金属阶上回响。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1a_0.mp3", "dur": 8.93}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐，你会带我走？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.23}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "永远。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1a.webp"}, "O_RC1ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "他们藏进旧港区的一间阁楼，雨声像窒息的被子。星核被包裹在布里，林夏每夜查看，像守候着一枚能颠覆城市的心脏。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ax_0.mp3", "dur": 12.1}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "我们得等机会再出手。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ax_1.mp3", "dur": 2.62}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "只要小雨安全就够了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ax_2.mp3", "dur": 2.42}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1ax.webp"}, "O_RC1ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏带着星核去找旧日联系人，换来一夜的庇护与沉重的人情账。代价是未来某晚他们得回报──或被拿去偿还。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ay_0.mp3", "dur": 11.23}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我要你们的人脉和一条后路。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ay_1.mp3", "dur": 3.0}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "签约前别托付太多。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1ay_2.mp3", "dur": 2.88}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1ay.webp"}, "O_RC1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏掏出泛蓝光的接口，留下一串虚假信号，身体朝对面楼顶冲出，像一颗被迫投出的子弹。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1b_0.mp3", "dur": 9.0}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我来引开他们。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1b_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "别做傻事。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1b_2.mp3", "dur": 2.18}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1b.webp"}, "O_RC1bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏独自穿过雨夜的天台群，爆破与追光像猎犬。最终她被渡鸦狙击手一枪撂倒，星核滚入暗影，城市没能在她掌心重生。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1bx_0.mp3", "dur": 12.36}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "结束。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1bx_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "小雨——", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1bx_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1bx.webp"}, "O_RC1by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏早已留下假信号，渡鸦被引入布满电磁陷阱的暗巷。陈默从侧翼出现，制服了突袭者，星核在雨中被再次夺回。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1by_0.mp3", "dur": 11.54}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "算我还你一命。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.23}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我们还欠顾衡一笔账。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC1by_2.mp3", "dur": 2.38}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC1by.webp"}, "O_RC2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核插入天台的投影节点，瞬间人群与高楼都成了屏幕，天穹实验的影像像暴雨般倾泻下来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2_0.mp3", "dur": 9.86}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "让整个城市看见。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2_1.mp3", "dur": 2.23}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你以为他们会相信？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2_2.mp3", "dur": 2.4}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2.webp"}, "O_RC2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "天穹的影像侵占了每家每户，市民的屏幕被迫见证被隐瞒的实验。街头的喧嚣像要将夜晚撕裂。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2a_0.mp3", "dur": 9.74}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "大家都看见了！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你毁了我安排的一切。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2a_2.mp3", "dur": 2.45}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2a.webp"}, "O_RC2ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "真相已播出，街头燃起抗议。林夏带着星核在混乱中消失，她知道这只是第一胜利，真正的审判还在路上。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ax_0.mp3", "dur": 10.99}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "先藏好，再反击。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ax_1.mp3", "dur": 2.5}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "这一次，不再沉默。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ax_2.mp3", "dur": 2.52}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2ax.webp"}, "O_RC2ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏站在天台中心，镜头紧盯她的脸。她被抓捕成了公开审判的证人，牺牲换来全城对穹顶的质问与愤怒。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ay_0.mp3", "dur": 10.8}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "你确定要这么做？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ay_1.mp3", "dur": 2.47}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "让他们看清真相。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2ay_2.mp3", "dur": 2.21}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2ay.webp"}, "O_RC2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏挑选了最能震撼市民的片段，屏幕上的画面像刀，割开顾衡的权威，却没有露出所有秘密网络。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2b_0.mp3", "dur": 9.29}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "先保留底牌。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2b_1.mp3", "dur": 1.92}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "聪明的选择。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.9}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2b.webp"}, "O_RC2bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏最终决定释放全部资料，穹顶的黑暗网络被撕开。顾衡被推上新闻头条，审判开始，但代价是穹顶对反抗的全面清算。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2bx_0.mp3", "dur": 12.89}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你以为这样就赢了？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.16}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "真相会自己开花结果。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2bx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.71}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2bx.webp"}, "O_RC2by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏保留关键备份，向外提供有限证据换取林小雨的安全与撤离通道。真相被分期公开，权力与道德的天平未彻底倾覆。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2by_0.mp3", "dur": 12.26}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "妥协是为了活下去。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.52}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我永远不会把小雨当赌注。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC2by_2.mp3", "dur": 2.86}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC2by.webp"}, "O_RC3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "天台上影像还未完全收束，顾衡已从高楼滑门缓步而来，金袖扣在雨中闪冷光，他像走向审判台。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3_0.mp3", "dur": 9.91}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你把我当成了剧终的反派。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3_1.mp3", "dur": 2.78}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我只想要一个答案。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3_2.mp3", "dur": 2.18}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3.webp"}, "O_RC3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核举在顾衡面前，影像在他眼前闪烁。顾衡的微笑像刀刃，屋顶的风把秘密吹得更寒冷。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3a_0.mp3", "dur": 9.94}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "你为什么要做这些？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.16}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "为了城市的秩序。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3a_2.mp3", "dur": 2.28}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3a.webp"}, "O_RC3ax": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡在言辞间转移责任，低调撤换高层以换取软着陆。林夏得到保证，但城市的体制只换了皮，真正的罪行潜入地下。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ax_0.mp3", "dur": 12.05}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "我们会自省。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ax_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我会盯着你。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ax_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3ax.webp"}, "O_RC3ay": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把完整证据投到天穹网络，顾衡的脸色瞬间崩裂。安保迟到，公众早已看到，董事长成了囚徒般的存在，权力瓦解的声音在雨中逐渐高涨。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ay_0.mp3", "dur": 13.99}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你不会赢的。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ay_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "正义会来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3ay_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3ay.webp"}, "O_RC3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把星核举高，像举起一把刀，条件简单明了：停止人体实验并安全放人。顾衡的笑容开始有裂缝。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3b_0.mp3", "dur": 10.63}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "交换：实验证据换小雨自由。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3b_1.mp3", "dur": 3.55}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "你要的代价太高。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3b_2.mp3", "dur": 2.16}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3b.webp"}, "O_RC3bx": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡答应暂时停止项目并释放林小雨，作为交换林夏必须交出星核。林小雨拥抱姐姐，城市在黎明前喘息，但真正的正义被押在未来的赌注里。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3bx_0.mp3", "dur": 13.94}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐，我们回家。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3bx_1.mp3", "dur": 2.14}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "先保命，再考虑未来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3bx_2.mp3", "dur": 2.81}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3bx.webp"}, "O_RC3by": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏递出了伪装的星核，实则早把真芯片藏在城中信任的人手里。顾衡得手的一刻，陈默与一群觉醒者发动清算，董事长在黎明前失势。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3by_0.mp3", "dur": 13.2}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "现在动手！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3by_1.mp3", "dur": 2.09}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "为小雨，也为所有人。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/O_RC3by_2.mp3", "dur": 2.76}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/O_RC3by.webp"}, "P1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "新港雨幕下，38层天台霓虹反射。林夏手指紧贴发蓝接口，目光像刀子。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P1_0.mp3", "dur": 8.11}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "别靠近，我只换一次。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P1_1.mp3", "dur": 2.66}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "交换开始。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P1_2.mp3", "dur": 2.33}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/P1.webp"}, "P2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "巷口汽雾，陈默靠墙藏影，目光死沉。三年前的债仍未结清。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P2_0.mp3", "dur": 7.27}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "你只要安全离开。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P2_1.mp3", "dur": 2.4}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "我有足够证据。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P2_2.mp3", "dur": 1.92}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/P2.webp"}, "P3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "高楼之巅，顾衡在窗前把玩金袖扣，城市像棋盘任他摆弄。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P3_0.mp3", "dur": 6.17}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "天穹只需一个借口。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P3_1.mp3", "dur": 2.59}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "命令已下。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/P3_2.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/P3.webp"}, "T_R": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林小雨悄无声息冲上天台，用相机挡住渡鸦的狙击镜，她把星核塞回林夏手中。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_R_0.mp3", "dur": 7.9}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐姐，别把牺牲留给我。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_R_1.mp3", "dur": 2.76}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "小雨，退开！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_R_2.mp3", "dur": 2.02}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_R.webp"}, "T_RA": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在交易最关键的瞬间，陈默的昔日同僚出现，他的旧身份被揭示：他曾为穹顶秘密情报部工作。这一秘密会改变所有抉择的代价。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA_0.mp3", "dur": 12.38}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "有些事，我做过。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA_1.mp3", "dur": 2.16}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "你早该说。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA.webp"}, "T_RA1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "雨夜中，林夏在渡鸦逼近时突然把一件雨衣往妹妹身上盖去，自己悄然换上带有发蓝接口的假手套，制造错觉——她不是目标。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1_0.mp3", "dur": 12.14}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "别动，一切按我说的来。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1_1.mp3", "dur": 2.78}, "2": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐——你在做什么？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1_2.mp3", "dur": 2.28}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA1.webp"}, "T_RA1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏一念之差收回手，渡鸦瞬间扣动扳机，子弹擦肩。芯片掉落屋檐，滚向黑暗。选择让交易瞬间失败，后果未定。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1a_0.mp3", "dur": 12.19}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "不——", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "太晚了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA1a.webp"}, "T_RA1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏在最后一秒缩回话语，无法让自己成交换物。渡鸦冷笑，夜色变得更冷。错失的机会像血一样流在天台。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1b_0.mp3", "dur": 11.47}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我不能……", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1b_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Raven", "text": "那就灭了你们。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA1b.webp"}, "T_RA1c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在最后一刻林夏删除了要公开的镜像，决定保留唯一的证据。她的选择让真相沉在水下，但也保护了妹妹的踪迹。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1c_0.mp3", "dur": 11.23}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "先保全她。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1c_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}, "2": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "这条路更长。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA1c_2.mp3", "dur": 1.9}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA1c.webp"}, "T_RA2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在拒绝后，林夏按下了手腕接口——不是求变，而是引爆了一个她藏好的数据备份向数个公共节点广播，诱使渡鸦露出真身并暴露回传路线。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2_0.mp3", "dur": 12.89}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "看你动的每一步，我都能回放。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2_1.mp3", "dur": 3.22}, "2": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "现在！逼他现身！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2_2.mp3", "dur": 3.38}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA2.webp"}, "T_RA2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "黎明前，陈默与林夏在楼梯间喘息，星核交给地下记者，城市的天际线被一束匿名亮光切割——真相正在通报每一处角落。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2a_0.mp3", "dur": 12.0}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "走，别回头。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.4}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "有她的安全，就够了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2a_2.mp3", "dur": 2.62}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA2a.webp"}, "T_RA2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "他们放走渡鸦，顾衡的防线应声而动。混乱中打开了通向核心的门——但代价是城市的街道被点燃，许多人因此受伤或失踪。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2b_0.mp3", "dur": 12.58}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我们别无选择。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2b_1.mp3", "dur": 1.92}, "2": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "……", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2b_2.mp3", "dur": 0.0}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA2b.webp"}, "T_RA2c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "假象被天穹识破，空中直升机投下暗影。天台瞬间被封锁，姐妹被迫分开逃命，林夏听到对讲里传来的绝望呼号。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2c_0.mp3", "dur": 11.69}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐！我被锁住了！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2c_1.mp3", "dur": 2.64}, "2": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "别放弃，等我。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA2c_2.mp3", "dur": 2.18}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA2c.webp"}, "T_RA3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏把真芯片拆分成两半：一半假装转交给顾衡以换取妹妹的短暂安全，另一半悄然藏入城市关键基础节点，成为沉默的证人。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3_0.mp3", "dur": 12.7}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "你想要全盘？给一半便够。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3_1.mp3", "dur": 3.5}, "2": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "聪明，年轻人。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3_2.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA3.webp"}, "T_RA3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏瞬间决定毁掉星核，宁可失去筹码也不愿让证据落入任何掌控者手中。芯片化为灰烬，信息随烟散去，天穹的秘密再次被锁进黑暗。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3a_0.mp3", "dur": 14.26}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "没有人能用它。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.94}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "为什么……？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3a_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA3a.webp"}, "T_RA3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在电梯门半开的一刻，林夏暗中与陈默交换了眼神——他们策划把芯片私下再卖给地下，表面上被收编，暗中保留反扑的筹码。未来的路更危险，但希望仍在。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3b_0.mp3", "dur": 15.38}, "1": {"speaker": "Chen Mo", "text": "别信他一面之词。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.3}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "我们把局做大。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3b_2.mp3", "dur": 1.92}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA3b.webp"}, "T_RA3c": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏突然把藏匿地点通过匿名信告诉一个记者，希望以此换取妹妹的安全。信息被放出后，局势复杂化，但林小雨得以被官方列为特别保护对象。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3c_0.mp3", "dur": 13.7}, "1": {"speaker": "Lin Xiaoyu", "text": "姐，你疯了吗？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3c_1.mp3", "dur": 2.04}, "2": {"speaker": "Lin Xia", "text": "这是为了你。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RA3c_2.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RA3c.webp"}, "T_RB": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "当事态推进，林夏在心里一震：真正的星核或许早被复制分散，手中的只是能引爆一场风暴的影像副本。每一步赌注都变成了一场关于真假与代价的博弈。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB_0.mp3", "dur": 14.78}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "这也许只是镜像。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB_1.mp3", "dur": 2.26}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB.webp"}, "T_RB1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏忽然把假货甩到地上，露出真正的星核。此举震惊所有人，也把渡鸦逼到了边缘：选择射杀还是停手？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1_0.mp3", "dur": 10.3}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "你们想要真相？那就拿去。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1_1.mp3", "dur": 3.38}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB1.webp"}, "T_RB1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏突然把枪放回桌上，表情像收回的刀刃。她选择不以命换命，转身钻入车流，夜色把她吞没。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1a_0.mp3", "dur": 9.89}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "够了。别再牺牲。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.83}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB1a.webp"}, "T_RB1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏在渡鸦的赤红目镜里看到妹妹的名字，她选择沉默，把核心的关键段落删去，用假证书换来林小雨的离去。夜依旧下着雨，良心被湿透。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1b_0.mp3", "dur": 14.04}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "带她走。求你。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB1b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.66}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB1b.webp"}, "T_RB2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦没有被戏耍，他手一抖，天台的监控灯像蜂群一样朝林夏扑来。她被逼进绝路，交易变成猎场。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2_0.mp3", "dur": 10.27}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "别演戏。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2_1.mp3", "dur": 1.99}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB2.webp"}, "T_RB2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "触发机关后，林夏看到远处监控灯光转向一处幼稚的监护楼。她意识到陷阱连带暴露了附近无辜区域，后悔填满胸口。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2a_0.mp3", "dur": 11.86}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "我……做错了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.99}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB2a.webp"}, "T_RB2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦假意同意，但在放人瞬间用磁扣锁住林夏，真相是她成为新的实验样本。林小雨哭喊的声音被夜雨吞没，林夏被带上了更冷的车。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2b_0.mp3", "dur": 13.15}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "姐！别走！", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB2b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.16}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB2b.webp"}, "T_RB3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "就在公开对峙达到顶点时，天穹自动介入：街道广播、无人机灯阵和数据库纷纷响应，城市像被埋伏的棋盘般被重新排布。每个人都被迫接受新的规则。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3_0.mp3", "dur": 14.9}, "1": {"speaker": "天穹", "text": "城市秩序将被维护。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3_1.mp3", "dur": 2.59}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB3.webp"}, "T_RB3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "就在子弹将发的一刻，顾衡转身取消命令，露出一个更加冷酷的笑容：他要的并非立即杀戮，而是把星核和林夏都抓回实验室，游戏进入更深一层。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3a_0.mp3", "dur": 13.46}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "留着她，我有更好的用途。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3a_1.mp3", "dur": 3.02}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB3a.webp"}, "T_RB3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "地下记者在金钱与安全的诱惑下出卖了数据的去向，星核的一部分被回收，林夏被迫带着残缺的真相逃亡。城市的裂缝被拼补，斗争继续但代价更深。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3b_0.mp3", "dur": 14.9}, "1": {"speaker": "记者", "text": "抱歉，这比革命更值钱。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RB3b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.86}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RB3b.webp"}, "T_RC": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "就在所有人做出决定的一刻，天穹开始回溯并改写投影，屏幕上的影像出现了未知注记，整座城市的网络像被看不见的手重新洗牌。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC_0.mp3", "dur": 12.22}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "它在干预我们的选择。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC_1.mp3", "dur": 2.62}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC.webp"}, "T_RC1": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "天台上风停了，一只黑影落下。渡鸦的帽影遮住了霓虹，远处狙击镜红光一闪，像死亡的承诺。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1_0.mp3", "dur": 9.43}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "目标：林夏。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1_1.mp3", "dur": 2.66}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC1.webp"}, "T_RC1a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林夏忽然听见天台上熟悉的枪声，她紧握星核的手抖了。有人在叫她的名字，像是召回她的责任——或者陷阱。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1a_0.mp3", "dur": 10.56}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "他们还在等我。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1a_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC1a.webp"}, "T_RC1b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在最后一刻，林夏取消了圈套，决定用自己换取林小雨的撤离。陈默只能眼睁睁看她进入枪口。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1b_0.mp3", "dur": 9.46}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "快走，带小雨离开。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC1b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.47}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC1b.webp"}, "T_RC2": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "林小雨在市区广场直播自己的追查记录，画面和情绪像火种一样蔓延，给了林夏一个不可预期的公众后盾。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2_0.mp3", "dur": 9.77}, "1": {"speaker": "林小雨", "text": "大家看见了吗？这是他们的真面目。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2_1.mp3", "dur": 3.5}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC2.webp"}, "T_RC2a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在撤离前，林夏发现影像里一段关键试验被黑影篡改。星核的另一份备份未见，她必须回头取证。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2a_0.mp3", "dur": 10.3}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "他们篡改了证据。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.02}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC2a.webp"}, "T_RC2b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "在最后关键一刻，天穹反制，备用上载失败。林夏不得不承认，穹顶的防火墙比她想象的更深。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2b_0.mp3", "dur": 9.48}, "1": {"speaker": "林夏", "text": "上传被切断了。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC2b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.09}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC2b.webp"}, "T_RC3": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "渡鸦的狙击镜忽然瞄向楼下人群，城市瞬间被他那把长枪的影子笼罩。谈判桌上，枪口静静地改变了规则。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3_0.mp3", "dur": 10.7}, "1": {"speaker": "渡鸦", "text": "别动。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3_1.mp3", "dur": 1.87}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC3.webp"}, "T_RC3a": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "顾衡假意承认罪行，引导媒体镜头到设好的阵地，瞬间调动保安将林小雨挟持为人质，局势骤然翻转。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3a_0.mp3", "dur": 10.42}, "1": {"speaker": "顾衡", "text": "为了和平，我自愿受审。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3a_1.mp3", "dur": 2.98}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC3a.webp"}, "T_RC3b": {"lines": {"0": {"speaker": "旁白", "text": "就在交换前，穹顶内侧势力突袭，真芯片从林夏手中被不明势力夺走，交换瞬间失效，所有人都成了棋子。", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3b_0.mp3", "dur": 10.78}, "1": {"speaker": "陈默", "text": "谁动了芯片？", "audio": "/static/comic/audio/T_RC3b_1.mp3", "dur": 2.23}}, "image": "/static/comic/img/T_RC3b.webp"}}